stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "Pending" as PENDING
    state "Approve" as APPROVED
    state "To Do" as TODO
    state "Done" as DONE
    state "Cancelled" as CANCELLED

    [*] --> PENDING : Create (Administrator only)
    PENDING --> APPROVED : Approve
    APPROVED --> TODO : Schedule
    TODO --> DONE : Complete
    PENDING --> CANCELLED : Cancel
    APPROVED --> CANCELLED : Cancel
    TODO --> CANCELLED : Cancel
    DONE --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]

    note right of PENDING
        Only Administrators can trigger transitions
        Viewers are read-only (UI and server checks)
        Each transition records actor, time, source and target
    end note
    note left of DONE
        Done and Cancelled are terminal
        Their TRANSITIONS target arrays are empty
    end note
